# Local deployment metadata for Staging / Production safety guards.
# Copy to backend/.env.staging and backend/.env.prod (both are gitignored via .env*).
# All identifiers (scriptId, GAS_DEPLOYMENT_ID, SPREADSHEET_ID) MUST be strictly distinct
# between Staging and Production (ADR-0006).
#
# Leave GAS_DEPLOYMENT_ID blank before the one-time initial `clasp create-deployment` bootstrap
# (`gas:push:*` allows a blank value, while `gas:deploy:*` requires the real deployment ID).
# Note: SPREADSHEET_ID here is used ONLY by local pre-deploy collision guards.
# At runtime, GAS reads SPREADSHEET_ID strictly from Apps Script Project Properties (ADR-0002).
GAS_DEPLOYMENT_ID=
SPREADSHEET_ID=YOUR_GOOGLE_SPREADSHEET_ID
